   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Project 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This response is integrated with the ECHO-funded multi-sector project titled &#x201C;Prepare, Respond, and Protect. Addressing the needs and protection concerns of crisis-affected girls, boys, women, and men in northern Mozambique&#x201D;. ShelterBox will be providing key items for 4,150 NFI kits, prioritising importing the aid that is challenging to procure in-country.  CARE will distribute shelter items alongside the NFIs and align to the specifications of the Shelter Cluster for a five person family.</narrative>
  </description>
